  "instance_name": "mapping_1",
  "label": "The baseball player is mapped as the one graduating from catcher to pitcher",
  "description": "The text 'the day you graduate from catcher to pitcher' is overlaid on the image of a baseball player holding a catcher's mitt. This creates an analogical mapping where the visual entity (baseball_player) is interpreted as the subject of the textual metaphor — the person who is transitioning from a catcher to a pitcher. The player's action (holding the ball in the mitt, poised to throw) visually reinforces the metaphor of 'graduating' into a new, more prominent role (pitcher).",
